{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "722ecf7a-11df-8a68-82f6-079c8fabe6ed",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T10:38:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm trying to reach the state tax division. Is this that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, this is the Newport City Clerk. You've got the city, not the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Okay. I dialed the number off my notice. Isn't the area code the same for everything in Rhode Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yeah, 401 covers the whole state. But the area code doesn't tell you which office. The prefix and the rest of the number do. So you probably have a digit off, or the number on the notice is for a different office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the area code's fine. It's the other digits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most likely, yes. The state Division of Taxation is a state office, not city. Check the notice again, or look up the Division of Taxation on the state website. They'll have the main line listed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:38:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll look at the notice again. Sorry, I'm in the middle of a game with my family. We paused it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Go finish your game."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Appreciate it. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T10:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, and happy New Year."
    }
  ],
